			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Correct ApplicationState import path in extension scanner\n\nUpdate the import statement in `Source/ExtensionManagement/Scanner.rs` to explicitly reference the nested `State::ApplicationState::ApplicationState` struct. The previous flat import path failed to resolve the type correctly within the current module hierarchy.\n\nThis change ensures the `ApplicationState` type is properly available for extension state management logic, preventing compilation errors related to missing type definitions in the extension scanner.",
