				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1117,
				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Replace legacy WindAdvancedSync with atomic sync placeholder\n\nRemove the verbose documentation and re-export logic from the legacy `WindAdvancedSync` module which was designed for batched, single-file document synchronization. Replace the file content with a concise header indicating this is a placeholder for the new atomic state synchronization system.\n\nThe legacy approach of syncing large documents in batches is being superseded by a fine-grained, atomic synchronization model to improve performance and conflict resolution. The original legacy implementation has been preserved in a sibling path for reference while this module prepares for the new IPC architecture.\n\nThis change clears the namespace for the upcoming atomic sync handlers and aligns with the project's shift towards more granular state management between Wind and Mountain.",
			"SHA": "5eff696f0ac3281d2c873c76c1fd5ff2e5780347"
		},
